<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>OTC Markets – Temporarily Unavailable</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.top{background:#3d3d3d;padding:40px 0;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center}
.main{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;padding:56px 24px;background:#fff}
.inner{max-width:480px;width:100%;border-left:4px solid #c0392b;padding-left:28px}
h1{font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:12px;letter-spacing:-0.2px}
p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;margin-bottom:10px}
p:last-of-type{margin-bottom:0}
.meta{margin-top:28px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #e8e8e8;font-size:12px;color:#999;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.dot{width:7px;height:7px;background:#e8a020;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;animation:p 2s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes p{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.35}}
footer{background:#2a2a2a;padding:14px 24px;text-align:center;font-size:11px;color:#777}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="top">
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 200 52" width="200" height="52" role="img" aria-label="OTC Markets">
<text y="36" font-family="Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif" font-size="26" fill="#fff">
  <tspan x="0" font-weight="700">OTC</tspan><tspan font-weight="300">Markets</tspan>
</text>
<rect x="0" y="41" width="44" height="3" fill="#c0392b" rx="1"/>
</svg>
</div>
<div class="main">
<div class="inner">
<h1>This site is temporarily unavailable</h1>
<p>OTC Markets is currently undergoing scheduled maintenance. We expect to be back online shortly.</p>
<p>We apologize for the inconvenience. Please try again in a few minutes.</p>
<div class="meta"><span class="dot"></span>Maintenance in progress</div>
</div>
</div>
<footer>&copy; 2026 OTC Markets Group Inc. All rights reserved.</footer>
</body>
</html>